/P 48 0 R
/T (P/ PRABHAVEE, founded in 2022 and led by lawyer Anumita Sarkar, is a specialised Strategy Consulting Practice based in Delhi. P/ PRABHAVEE has engaged in strategic consultation with nearly 20 CSOs, NGOs, Social impact start-ups, including mid to established organisations, engaged with 5 Academic Institutions and Universities, and over 50 organisations including global collaborations. It has trained over 1100 individuals and collaborated with more than 125+ experts across the social sector, consulting, academia, and public policy.)
/E (P/ PRABHAVEE, founded in 2022 and led by lawyer Anumita Sarkar, is a specialised Strategy Consulting Practice based in Delhi. P/ PRABHAVEE has engaged in strategic consultation with nearly 20 CSOs, NGOs, Social impact start-ups, including mid to established organisations, engaged with 5 Academic Institutions and Universities, and over 50 organisations including global collaborations. It has trained over 1100 individuals and collaborated with more than 125+ experts across the social sector, consulting, academia, and public policy.)
